     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Workplace",
     "texto": [
      "To say where you work, use **pracuję w** and the place in the locative: **w szkole**, **w biurze**, **w szpitalu**.",
      "The locative already appeared to show places in the house."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Jobs",
     "texto": [
      "After **jestem** («I am»), the job noun takes the instrumental: **Jestem nauczycielem** (man), **Jestem nauczycielką** (woman).",
      "Unlike English, the noun changes form."
     ],
